<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Scientific Knowledge Graphs – Interoperability Framework (SKG-IF) WG; OSTrails Project" .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2025-11-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
