<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/title> "The SKG-IF Ontology: Service Extension" .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "srv" .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SRV-O is an extension of the SKG-IF Ontology (SKG-O) that introduces entities necessary to model Service-type objects used to process data in various use-cases, as well as their relationships with well-established entities in the SKG-IF data model. This extension is developed in the context of the OSTrails project." .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SRV-O: Service Extension" .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/ontology/> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.1.0" .
